This repository contains source code, measurement scripts and measurement results
only. It contains no model weights and no third-party corpora. A component-by-
component map of licences and attribution requirements is in docs/LICENSES.md.

The measurement results are in evidence/: five expert-routing traces over 92 MoE
layers, the 93-layer comparison against the reference C engine, the raw per-step
training losses and the run manifest, with SHA256SUMS over all of them. They are
this project's own measurements. The five texts that were traced were written for
this study and are carried in the trace manifests; none of them is taken from a
publication or a third-party corpus. The routing arrays (trace.bin) are released
under CC0-1.0 as functional measurements of a computation; the rest of evidence/,
like the rest of the documentation, is CC BY 4.0. See evidence/README.md and
docs/traces/README.md.

